===Etymology 1===
[[File:Bichon Frisé lying down.jpg|thumb|A dog '''lying''' in the grass.]]
{{root|en|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|lien}}, {{m|enm|liggen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|liċġan}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*liggjan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ligjaną}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}.

Cognate with {{cog|fy|lizze}}, {{cog|nl|liggen}}, {{cog|de|liegen}}, {{cog|da|-}} and {{cog|nb|ligge}}, {{cog|sv|ligga}}, {{cog|is|-}}, {{cog|fo|-}} and {{cog|nn|liggja}}, {{cog|got|𐌻𐌹𐌲𐌰𐌽}}; and with {{cog|la|lectus||bed}}, {{cog|ga|luí}}, {{cog|ru|лежа́ть}}, {{cog|sq|lag||troop, band, encampment}}.

As a noun for {{m|en|position}}, the [[#Noun|noun]] has the same etymology above as the [[#Verb|verb]].

